，見之歎曰：「此子日下無雙。」遂申拜親之禮。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p002:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p002:m0133"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"洽兄二人，由名與稱謂定。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"a-liang027-zhao-father","subject_person_id":"6bo_qfq_pl9_ABA","object_person_id":"6bo_qfq_pl9_AB","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"父坦，齊中書郎。溉少孤貧，與兄沼弟洽俱知名","lineage":"paternal","interpretation_status":"editorial_inference"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-025","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches","source_id":"s-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches-ws12757141","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p003","quote":"溉字茂灌，撝弟子也。父坦，齊中書郎。溉少孤貧，與兄沼弟洽俱知名，起家王國左常侍。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p003:m0025","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p003:m0011"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"據溉父坦、兄沼弟洽同段讀為兄弟共父；洽本傳亦記父坦。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"6bo_qfq_pl9_AB","source_assertion_id":"a-liang027-zhao-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-025","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches","source_id":"s-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches-ws12757141","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p003","quote":"溉字茂灌，撝弟子也。父坦，齊中書郎。溉少孤貧，與兄沼弟洽俱知名，起家王國左常侍。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p003:m0025","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-025-daoqia-branches:p003:m0011","source_term":"父坦，齊中書郎。溉少孤貧，與兄沼弟洽俱知名"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"據溉父坦、兄沼弟洽同段讀為兄弟共父；洽本傳亦記父坦。","person_id":"6bo_qfq_pl9_ABA"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-027-d